<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle Friday roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle Friday roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet Friday. No sales on slaughter steers, few slaughter heifer sales steady.</p>
<p>Inquiry and demand light. - USDA</p>
<p>Confirmed - 500	 last week - 4200	last year - none</p>
<p>Sales confirmed on 500 heifers Friday. Sales confirmed last week on 83,800 head, volume includes 24,100 or about 28 percent of contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>heifers - Select and Choice 2-3, 1075-1100 lbs 65.00.</p>
</text>
